A BankAccount class has a private field double balance and a mutator method:

public void setBalance(double balance) {
    balance = balance;
}

A client calls account.setBalance(500.0); on an account whose balance was 100.0. What is the balance after the call?

Consider this class:

public class Point {
    private int x;
    private int y;
    public void setX(int x) { this.x = x; }
    public void setY(int y) { this.y = y; }
}

Point p = new Point();
p.setX(3);
p.setY(7);
p.setX(10);

What are the final values of p's fields x and y?
